tices",{"title":250,"path":251,"stem":252},"What are Digital Twins?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhat-are-digital-twins","blog\u002FWhat are Digital Twins",{"title":254,"path":255,"stem":256},"What makes Mixed Reality the next big thing?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhat-makes-mixed-reality-the-next-big-thing","blog\u002FWhat makes Mixed Reality the next big thing",{"title":258,"path":259,"stem":260},"Why Game Engines?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhy-game-engines","blog\u002FWhy Game Engines",{"title":262,"path":263,"stem":264},"Why we need User Experience Design?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhy-we-need-user-experience-design","blog\u002FWhy we need User Experience Design",false,{"id":267,"title":42,"author":268,"body":272,"date":459,"description":460,"extension":461,"image":462,"meta":463,"minRead":464,"navigation":465,"path":43,"seo":466,"stem":44,"__hash__":467},"blog\u002Fblog\u002FBest 5 Hybrid Mobile App Development Frameworks.md",{"name":269,"avatar":270},"Aghil Jose",{"src":271,"alt":269},"\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fabout.webp",{"type":273,"value":274,"toc":449},"minimark",[275,279,282,287,294,297,304,320,324,330,333,337,351,355,361,364,368,382,386,392,395,399,413,417,423,426,429,443,446],[276,277,278],"p",{},"Nowadays, people require valuable business information at their fingertips.\nThe number of companies that enter into the mobile applications rather than\njust to go with a desktop website is increasing day by day. This will play a\nmajor role in helping them solve important issues on the go as well as control\ntheir online exposure. Recent emergence of large number of hybrid application\ndevelopment frameworks are results of these events. Choosing the right\ntechnology stack can help a company to achieve its goals and ultimately be a\nsuccess.",[276,280,281],{},"With the number of tools out there, it might be sometime difficult on settling\non a particular stack. So, here are the best tools according to my humble\nopinion.",[283,284,286],"h2",{"id":285},"_1-flutter","1. Flutter",[276,288,289],{},[290,291],"img",{"alt":292,"src":293},"flutter","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F080620\u002Fflutter.webp",[276,295,296],{},"Flutter was launched by Google in 2017 and is among the top contenders in the\nindustry. It is used to produce native-looking products for various operating\nsystems.",[276,298,299,303],{},[300,301,302],"strong",{},"Features"," **",[305,306,307,311,314,317],"ul",{},[308,309,310],"li",{},"Hot Reload.",[308,312,313],{},"Minimal Code.",[308,315,316],{},"Fast Development.",[308,318,319],{},"Access to Native Feature.",[283,321,323],{"id":322},"_2-react-native","2. React Native",[276,325,326],{},[290,327],{"alt":328,"src":329},"ionic","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F080620\u002Fionic.webp",[276,331,332],{},"React Native brings with it, the features of JavaScript and React. It is also\npreferred for native application development and is able to give flutter a run\nfor their money.",[276,334,335,303],{},[300,336,302],{},[305,338,339,342,345,348],{},[308,340,341],{},"Modular and intuitive architecture similar to React.",[308,343,344],{},"Live Reload.",[308,346,347],{},"Strong performance for mobile environments.",[308,349,350],{},"Community-driven.",[283,352,354],{"id":353},"_3-ionic","3. Ionic",[276,356,357],{},[290,358],{"alt":359,"src":360},"jQueryMobile","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F080620\u002FjQueryMobile.webp",[276,362,363],{},"This platform is based on CSS and reaches its maximum potential when used\njointly with AngularJS.",[276,365,366,303],{},[300,367,302],{},[305,369,370,373,376,379],{},[308,371,372],{},"JavaScript components.",[308,374,375],{},"Influence from Angular.",[308,377,378],{},"Based on web standards.",[308,380,381],{},"Cordova based plugins.",[283,383,385],{"id":384},"_4-jquery-mobile","4. jQuery Mobile",[276,387,388],{},[290,389],{"alt":390,"src":391},"reactNative","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F080620\u002FreactNative.webp",[276,393,394],{},"This one does not try to adopt a native look. It keeps its individuality while\nworking flawlessly in various platforms. It is a great choice if you want to\ncreate something exceptional instead of sticking to template designs.",[276,396,397,303],{},[300,398,302],{},[305,400,401,404,407,410],{},[308,402,403],{},"Built on jQuery core.",[308,405,406],{},"HTML5 Markup-driven configuration.",[308,408,409],{},"Unified UI widgets.",[308,411,412],{},"Powerful Ajax-powered navigation system.",[283,414,416],{"id":415},"_5-xamarin","5. Xamarin",[276,418,419],{},[290,420],{"alt":421,"src":422},"xamarin","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F080620\u002Fxamarin.webp",[276,424,425],{},"Xamarin does have a good track record as well as a large community of\nsatisfied followers. This framework allows you to create universal apps and\nrun them on different devices without sacrificing native design",[283,427,302],{"id":428},"features",[305,430,431,434,437,440],{},[308,432,433],{},"Simplified testing.",[308,435,436],{},"Support from Microsoft.",[308,438,439],{},"Interesting platform-specific options to supplement the general codebase.",[308,441,442],{},"Performance is similar to native products.",[276,444,445],{},"To make the right choice, you should analyse your needs, draft an image of\nyour end product, and select the most suitable technology stack.",[276,447,448],{},"Disclaimer : The views and opinions expressed in the article belong solely to the\nauthor, and not necessarily to the author's employer, organisation, committee\nor other group or individual.",{"title":450,"searchDepth":451,"depth":451,"links":452},"",2,[453,454,455,456,457,458],{"id":285,"depth":451,"text":286},{"id":322,"depth":451,"text":323},{"id":353,"depth":451,"text":354},{"id":384,"depth":451,"text":385},{"id":415,"depth":451,"text":416},{"id":428,"depth":451,"text":302},"2020-06-08","An article regarding the prominent hybrid mobile application development tools.","md","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F080620\u002FhybridTitle.webp",{},4,true